<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Entrar | Huplex</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        :root {
            --bg: #07080F;
            --panel: #0C0D18;
            --accent: #3D72FF;
            --accent-soft: #6B9AFF;
            --text: #fff;
            --muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.38);
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }

        body {
            background: var(--bg);
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .login-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 980px;
            min-height: 580px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
        }

        /* ── Painel conceitual ── */
        .login-left {
            background: var(--panel);
            padding: 48px 44px 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .login-left::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background:
                linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(61,114,255,0.12) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 100% 0%, rgba(61,114,255,0.15), transparent 55%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .login-left::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 32px 32px;
            mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, black 0%, transparent 85%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .login-left > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        .brand-mark {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .brand-name {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text);
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .brand-name em {
            font-style: normal;
            color: var(--accent-soft);
        }

        .hero-visual {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 200px;
            margin: 8px 0 28px;
        }

        .hero-visual img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 280px;
            height: auto;
            animation: hero-float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes hero-float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
        }

        .login-tagline h2 {
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.035em;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .login-tagline h2 .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-soft), var(--accent));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .login-tagline p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            max-width: 340px;
        }

        .value-pillars {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 28px;
        }

        .pillar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
        }

        .pillar:hover {
            background: rgba(61,114,255,0.06);
            border-color: rgba(61,114,255,0.18);
        }

        .pillar-icon {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: rgba(61,114,255,0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(61,114,255,0.2);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            color: var(--accent-soft);
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .pillar-icon svg {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            stroke: currentColor;
            fill: none;
            stroke-width: 1.8;
            stroke-linecap: round;
            stroke-linejoin: round;
        }

        .pillar strong {
            display: block;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .pillar span {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        /* ── Formulário ── */
        .login-right {
            background: #090a12;
            padding: 56px 48px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .login-right h3 {
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .login-right .sub {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .form-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }

        .form-label {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .form-control {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--text);
            padding: 12px 14px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-family: inherit;
            width: 100%;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            outline: none;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: rgba(61,114,255,0.55);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(61,114,255,0.12);
        }

        .form-control::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

        .form-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .form-row label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .form-row label input { accent-color: var(--accent); }

        .form-row a {
            color: rgba(61,114,255,0.75);
            font-size: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .form-row a:hover { color: var(--accent-soft); }

        .btn-login {
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, #2d5ce0 100%);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 13px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: filter 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(61,114,255,0.35);
        }

        .btn-login:hover {
            filter: brightness(1.08);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 28px rgba(61,114,255,0.45);
        }

        .alert-danger {
            background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25);
            color: #f87171;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .login-wrapper { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .login-left { display: none; }
            .login-right {
                border-left: none;
                padding: 40px 28px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="login-wrapper">
    <div class="login-left">
        <div class="brand">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/huplex-mark.svg') }}" alt="" class="brand-mark" width="44" height="44">
            <div class="brand-name">Hup<em>lex</em></div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/login-hero.svg') }}" alt="" width="280" height="245">
        </div>

        <div class="login-tagline">
            <h2>Pense além.<br><span class="highlight">Gerencie com clareza.</span></h2>
            <p>
                A Huplex conecta estratégia, dados e pessoas em um só lugar —
                para transformar gestão humana em decisões mais inteligentes.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="value-pillars">
            <div class="pillar">
                <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 1 6 6c0 2.2-1.2 4.1-3 5.2V17H9v-2.8A6 6 0 0 1 12 3z"/><path d="M9 19h6v2H9z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Insight, não só processo</strong>
                    <span>Visão que antecipa cenários e apoia escolhas melhores.</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"/><path d="M8 16l4-4M14 10l4-4"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Tecnologia que simplifica</strong>
                    <span>Dados integrados, fluxos claros e experiência fluida.</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 11c1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3S17.7 5 16 5s-3 1.3-3 3 1.3 3 3 3zM8 11c1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3S9.7 5 8 5 5 6.3 5 8s1.3 3 3 3zM16 19c1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3s-1.3-3-3-3-3 1.3-3 3 1.3 3 3 3zM8 19c1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3s-1.3-3-3-3-3 1.3-3 3 1.3 3 3 3z"/><path d="M10.5 10.5l3 3M13.5 10.5l-3 3"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Pessoas no centro</strong>
                    <span>Desenvolvimento, talento e maturidade organizacional alinhados.</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="login-right">
        <h3>Bem-vindo de volta</h3>
        <p class="sub">Entre com suas credenciais para acessar a plataforma</p>

        {% if error %}
            <div class="alert-danger">{{ error.messageKey|trans(error.messageData, 'security') }}</div>
        {% endif %}

        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_login') }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token('authenticate') }}">

            <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label" for="email">E-mail</label>
                <input class="form-control" id="email" type="email" name="email"
                       value="{{ last_username }}" placeholder="seu@email.com"
                       autocomplete="email" autofocus required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label" for="password">Senha</label>
                <input class="form-control" id="password" type="password" name="password"
                       placeholder="••••••••" autocomplete="current-password" required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <label>
                    <input type="checkbox" name="_remember_me">
                    Lembrar-me
                </label>
                <a href="#">Esqueci a senha</a>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-login">Entrar na plataforma</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
